## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.5 Preview (unverified)
- **Short description:** Presumed preview of the next general-purpose LongCat model from Meituan. The LongCat-DeepResearch technical materials state that its model improvements "are intended to be incorporated into the next general-purpose LongCat model release," which a 2.5 preview would represent. No verified public model card, weight release, or API ID was found.
- **Provider / access:** longcat.chat / LongCat API platform (JS app; no readable API listing extracted). No verified provider/model ID.
- **Release / knowledge:** no verified release date found; LongCat-2.0 (the latest verified release) shipped July 2026.
- **IDs:** no verified public ID found (no Free ID exists on Zen)
- **Context window:** no verified public figure found; LongCat-2.0's specs do not transfer to a 2.5 preview.
- **Modalities:** no verified public figure found.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-27):** no verified public pricing found.
